e\\\":\\\"workspace\\\",\\\"kind\\\":\\\"id\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"WS-7e7ae7691b1a\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"story\\\",\\\"kind\\\":\\\"id\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"STORY-260830-3drr2m\\\"}]}}}]}],\\\"next_cursor\\\":\\\"YWN0aXZpdHktY3Vyc29yLnYxOmRlc2NlbmRpbmc6NzI\\\",\\\"view\\\":\\\"effective\\\"}\\n===\\nSearch .task-board/ directory recursively for lines matching a regex pattern. Similar to ripgrep scoped to the board.\\n\\nUsage:\\n  task-board grep <pattern> [flags]\\n\\nFlags:\\n  -C, --context int     Show N lines before and after each match\\n      --file string     Filter files by glob pattern (e.g. progress.md, \\\"*.md\\\", README.md)\\n      --format string   Output format for --json mode: \\\"json\\\" or \\\"compact\\\" (default \\\"json\\\")\\n  -h, --help            help for grep\\n  -i, --ignore-case     Case-insensitive search\\n\\nGlobal Flags:\\n      --board-dir string         Path to the board directory (overrides TASK_BOARD_DIR and config local.board_dir) (default \\\".task-board\\\")\\n      --context-profile string   Agent context profile override: full or lite\\n      --insecure                 Skip TLS certificate verification (for self-signed certs)\\n      --json                     Output in JSON format\\n      --no-update-check          Disable automatic update check\\n      --remote string            Remote board server URL (overrides TASK_BOARD_REMOTE)\\n      --remote-board string      Remote board ID (overrides TASK_BOARD_ID)\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 11589,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 2898,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}","correlation_facts":{"tool_name":"bash","outcome":"success"}}}
